# Base URL of the SWASTHYAGUIDE FastAPI server (Stage 4, in app/).
#
# During development the Vite dev server proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8000, so the
# default below only needs to be reachable from this machine. If you change it
# to a non-default port, point VITE_API_BASE_URL at that origin instead of
# editing vite.config.ts.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
